      "schema_version": "aspr_gear",
      "text": "The paper examines ordered 90° ferroelectric domains in Br-RPP films, linking planar chirality and alternating SHG-CD to atomic-row arrangements and reporting domain-dependent Rashba spin splitting. The experimental case is supported by complementary ferroelectric, optical, atomic-imaging, and calculation evidence. The remaining limitations concern the explicit prior-art comparison, the POM-defined “domain-free” comparator, and the quantitative correspondence between bulk structure and observed film phases."
